# ─── PRIVATE LEARNING DOCS ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The docs/ folder contains personal learning notes and interview Q&A.
# To keep it PRIVATE (not pushed to GitHub), uncomment the line below:
#
# docs/
#
# To make it private permanently:
#   1. Uncomment "docs/" above
#   2. Run: git rm -r --cached docs/
#   3. Run: git commit -m "remove docs from public repo"
#   4. Push to GitHub — docs/ will no longer appear in your public repo
#   5. The folder stays on your local machine (only gitignored, not deleted)
